message: "If you use FIRE-X in your work, please cite it as below."
title: "FIRE-X: Microgravity Combustion Intelligence for Spacecraft Fire Safety"
abstract: >-
  An open platform built for the NASA Space Apps Challenge 2026 (Flame in Freefall)
  that unifies NASA microgravity combustion records (FLEX, BASS-II, SAFFIRE and related
  investigations) into a provenance-labelled database, adds a SQL-grounded AI assistant,
  a mission fire-hazard simulator for spacecraft and planetary habitats, and an ESP32
  gas and flame sensor node.
type: software
